<title>USA: Mazda February US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda February US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     5,475	     6,816	    -16.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,374	     2,898	    -14.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 6,402	     8,391	    -20.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,082	     1,002	    +12.5</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    10,348	    12,754	    -17.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   5,025	     5,766	    -11.1</p>
<p> Import Car		11,110	    13,860	    -18.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	     2,235	     2,150	     +6.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate.  Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
